# Merchant-owned files — managed in the Shopify theme editor, not by developers.
# Ignoring these prevents `shopify theme push` and `shopify theme dev` from
# clobbering customizer changes (typography, color schemes, section order,
# nav links, page content, etc.).
#
# To intentionally sync merchant state back into the repo, run:
#   shopify theme pull --live --only=config/settings_data.json --only='templates/*.json'

config/settings_data.json
templates/*.json
templates/customers/*.json
